**I048** · Feature without acceptance criteria

feature 'signin' has no acceptance criteria

A `feature` has no `acceptance` field, or an empty one. Add acceptance criteria describing when the feature is done; they can be added progressively.

[Documentation](https://github.com/leaderiop/SpecForge/blob/main/docs/diagnostics.md#i048)

---

**I080** · Entity without owner

feature 'signin' has no owner

A `feature`, `milestone`, `deliverable` or `release` has no `owner` field. Set `owner` to the person or team responsible.

[Documentation](https://github.com/leaderiop/SpecForge/blob/main/docs/diagnostics.md#i080)

---

**I081** · Feature without effort estimate

feature 'signin' has no effort estimate

A `feature` has no `effort` field. Set `effort` to one of xs, s, m, l, xl.

[Documentation](https://github.com/leaderiop/SpecForge/blob/main/docs/diagnostics.md#i081)

---

